<title>FRANCE: France to sell 10,000 T wheat to Iraq as food aid.</title>
<headline>France to sell 10,000 T wheat to Iraq as food aid.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>France will hold a tender on December 11 to ship 10,000 tonnes of soft wheat to Iraq as food aid, the national grain office ONIC said on Monday.</p>
<p>The wheat is for shipment between December 27, 1996 and January 19, 1997, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
